  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271296</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……&lt;Suzu&gt;ちゃん、
平気？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Are you okay, &lt;Suzu&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271388</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いえ……
これもまた試練……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>No... This has been
another trial...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271388</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……それに
来てよかったです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...But it was good for
me to come here.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271432</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それは刀？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That's a katana?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271544</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ええ……最後に倒した
魔物の体の中から
出てきました</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yes... It emerged from
the body of the last
monster I defeated.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271544</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>柄に父の名が
彫ってあります</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Father's name is
carved into its grip.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271636</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それじゃあ、それは
&lt;Suzu&gt;ちゃんの父ちゃんの
刀ってことか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Then, you're saying it
was your dad's katana?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271744</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>はい。父と母は、
この闘技場で果てました</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yes. Father and Mother both
met their ends in this arena.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271744</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いえ……
わたしがこの、手で……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>No... With my own hands, I...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271820</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Suzu&gt;ちゃん、いいよ……
そのことは……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's okay, &lt;Suzu&gt;...
That was just...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272004</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……きっと、あの時、
父の手から落ちた武器が</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...I'm certain this is the weapon
which fell from his hand back then.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272004</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>何かのはずみで、
あの魔物の体内に
取り込まれたのでしょう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>By happenstance, it
ended up buried within
that monster's body.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272004</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>こうして再びわたしの手に、
帰ってくるなんて……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And somehow, it's now returned
to my hands, like this...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272060</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……それ、使うのか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...You gonna use it?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272300</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ええ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Indeed...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272300</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>確かにこれは闘技場で
ふたりと戦ったあの時、
わたしを傷つけた刀……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This is the very katana which
brought harm to me when I battled
the two of them, in this arena.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272300</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>つらい記憶の中に
あります……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It appears in the most
painful of all my memories...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272300</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも……
あれは一族の過ち、
脇の甘さ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But... That was our clan's failing.
A weak link in our armor.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272300</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>その戒めのために、
わたしはこの父の刀を
持っていきたいのです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And so, I wish to carry this, my
father's own katana, as a
reminder of lessons learned.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>4</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272348</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そ、っか……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I...see...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272424</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>父上……ありがたく、
使わせていただきます</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Dearest Father... I will
use this with gratitude.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272548</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>本当はあんなこと、
言ってるけど……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That's what she says,
but the truth is...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272548</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>きっとお父さんの思い出が
欲しかったんだよ、
きっと……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm sure she wanted a
memento of her father.
I'm sure of it...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
